# A selected instance keeps ancestor listSpecs during replacement. Local
# literal width is replaced; a width stated by a template remains required.
replacement/path/inline, Compose an inline indexed selection with a field path, *2+[{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}].properties.member, member:'Tiffany', norm
replacement/ancestor/open, Bare open ancestor imposes no individual member value, {holder:{data:{...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<='KTiffany', member:'KTiffany', norm
replacement/ancestor/template, Open ancestor tail retains its member template, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:$}}|...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<='KTiffany', member:'KTiffany', norm
replacement/ancestor/prefix, Template applies beyond the schema's represented prefix, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:$}}|{properties:{member:$}}...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<='KTiffany', member:'KTiffany', norm
replacement/guard/stringType, String listSpec rejects a numeric replacement, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:$}}|...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<=123, <REJECTED>, norm
replacement/guard/declaredSize, A size in the listSpec survives replacement, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:*7+$}}|...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Tiffany'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<='KTiffany', <REJECTED>, norm
replacement/guard/literal, A literal in the listSpec survives replacement, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}|...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Tiffany'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member<<='KTiffany', <REJECTED>, norm
replacement/guard/equality, Ordinary equality cannot overwrite an established member, {holder:{data:{{properties:{member:$}}|...}}|holder:{data:{{properties:{member:'Bruce'}} {properties:{member:'Tiffany'}}}}}.holder.data@[2].properties.member='KTiffany', <REJECTED>, norm
replacement/user/persistence, Inline replacement persists through a fresh indexed read and preserves siblings, *2+[& %W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data].properties.member<<='KTiffany'//:member:'KTiffany'\n%W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data@[2].properties.member//:member:'KTiffany'\n%W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data@[1].properties.member//:member:'Bruce'\n%W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data@[3].properties.member//:member:'Mats', -, world, user_3.pr
replacement/user/rejected, An incompatible replacement leaves the original member intact, %W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data@[2].properties.member<<=123//:<REJECTED>\n%W.bruceLong.projects.data.boardElement.data.TaskList.data@[2].properties.member//:member:'Tiffany', -, world, user_3.pr
